        <mxCell id="n_notes" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#555555;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="Cancel: the assigned Event Coordinator may cancel at any stage; only the arrows from Planning, Confirmed and Postponed are drawn.&#xa;Safety review (Week 7 change #6, SPM-86): the assigned Event Coordinator submits a Planning event whose arrangements are held for the Safety Officer&#39;s Operational Safety Check. The Safety Officer&#39;s decision (SPM-87), or a significant change while it is pending (SPM-88), returns it to Planning; an approved event is then confirmed from Planning. It can also be cancelled.&#xa;Withdraw: recorded by the Event Coordinator when the organiser asks, outside the system, to withdraw a request that is under review.&#xa;Significant change: a change to date / time, attendance, venue or equipment requirements on a confirmed event returns it to Planning so the affected arrangements are re-checked.&#xa;Venue retired or marked unavailable: the event keeps its status and its information; the affected venue booking is flagged for the Event Coordinator to review (Week 7 Change #2)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="76" width="1100" x="55" y="362" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
